test('콤보: 동료 접촉 후 2틱 넘어 골 · 상대 접촉/새 턴/슈터만 접촉 실패',()=>{
 const {RULES,contact,physicsTick}=vm.runInNewContext(rulesSource+';({RULES,contact,physicsTick})');
 for(const scenario of ['pass','opponent','newTurn','shooter','opponentThenMate','shooterAgain']){
  const s=RULES.init(data,4);RULES.apply(s,{k:'flick',who:0,dx:60,dy:0});
  const touch=id=>{const v=s.players[id];v.x=540;v.y=560;v.vx=0;v.vy=-1;s.ball.x=540;s.ball.y=500;s.ball.vy=0;contact(s,v,s.ball,[]);};
  touch(scenario==='shooter'?0:1);jsonState(s);
  assert.equal(s.lastTouch.flicker,0);
  if(scenario==='opponent'||scenario==='opponentThenMate')touch(3);
  if(scenario==='opponentThenMate')touch(1);
  if(scenario==='shooterAgain')touch(0);
  if(scenario==='newTurn'){s.phase='aim';RULES.apply(s,{k:'flick',who:0,dx:60,dy:0});assert.equal(s.lastTouch,null);}
  s.players.forEach((v,i)=>{v.x=100+i*140;v.y=700;v.vx=0;v.vy=0;});s.ball.x=540;s.ball.y=100;s.ball.vx=0;s.ball.vy=-10;s.tick+=10;
  const es=[];for(let i=0;i<40&&s.phase==='settle';i++){s.tick++;es.push(...physicsTick(s).events);}
  assert(es.some(e=>e.k==='goal'));assert.equal(es.some(e=>e.k==='combo'),['pass','opponentThenMate','shooterAgain'].includes(scenario),scenario);
 }
 const u=RULES.init(data,4);u.phase='settle';u.ball.x=540;u.ball.y=2;u.ball.vy=-10;u.wallHits=1;
 assert(RULES.tick(u).events.some(e=>e.k==='bounceGoal'));
});
